{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45581","headline":"古意九首 二 · 贯休","name":"古意九首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阳乌烁万物，草木怀春恩。\n茫茫尘土飞，培壅名利根。\n我本是蓑笠，幼知天子尊。\n学爲毛氏诗，亦多直致言。\n不慕需臑类，附势同崩奔。\n唯寻桃李蹊，去去长者门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}